Hmm.  My most common reason to polypile is that I've found a /
polymorph but not a source of MR/reflection above DL8.  I'll bless up
all the amulets/magic armor I've found and try to get one or both of
those (hopefully MR) before descending.

Seems to me that the later in the game you get, the less worthwhile
polypiling is; by the Castle, you can wish up whatever kit you're
missing and just go ascend.  Earlier on, getting some key items is
much more likely to be a game-breaking, life-saving event.


